{
    "title": "Shadow War: Idle RPG Survival",
    "description": "10000 gems Giftcode: WELCOMESW\r\n\r\nDarkness is taking over the world! As the chosen knight of the Shadow Clan, your mission in this offline RPG is to lead your army into battles, protect your kingdoms, harness the dark power of the shadows and bring peace to the shadow realm. Start the journey to become the ultimate Shadow Slayer. \r\n\r\nEvil monsters have returned! Fight epic battles as a dark knight in a war for ultimate supremacy. Choose the most powerful knights to build your own army. Summon weapons and armors to strengthen your legion, upgrade your dark knight skills, and unlock powerful pets to defeat evil monsters.\r\n\r\nShadow War: Idle RPG Survival is a combination of idle action role-playing and adventure. Featuring idle RPG gameplay with both survival and offline idle RPG game elements. Shadow War provides hundreds of weapons, armors, skills with gacha features and the defenses are divided into several different worlds and endless levels.\r\n\r\nThe auto-battle system delivers idle gameplay that allows you to continuously earn resources for upgrading your hero\u2019s attack power, speed, health regen, HP, damage and critical chance, making your conquest easier. Take command in this free RPG and enjoy the ultimate dark fantasy adventure!\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\u2605 RPG Adventure Battles\r\n- Leave no monsters standing: Defeat all demons and save the kingdom.\r\n- Explore adventure features: Numerous dungeons (gem dungeon, gold dungeon, relic dungeon, trait dungeon, ring dungeon) and worlds (zodiac, world, tower, alchemy, mine) to discover, train your hero and find valuable treasure.\r\n- Crush the enemies: Defeat enemies, conquer bosses and claim gems! Eliminate every evil in your path!\r\n\r\n\u2605 RPG Progression & Strategy\r\n- Idle RPG offline adventure: Dive into a thrilling fantasy world filled with strategic battles!\r\n- Evolve your warriors: Level up your legion for intense battle games.\r\n- Customize your heroes: Customize your knight's appearance and abilities. Choose your weapons, armor, and skills to create the perfect Shadow Slayer.\r\n- Enhance your hero\u2019s strength: Equip swords, armor and weapons to gain an edge in combat.\r\n- Create your battle strategy: Combine attackers, gear, and control resources to dominate. Who will be the last one standing? Get ready for war and lead your shadow knight warrior to victory!\r\n\r\n\u2605 Idle Auto-Battle\r\n- Build your hero lineup: Your heroes will automatically fight on your behalf!\r\n- Earn rewards while offline: This idle clicker lets you collect rewards even when you\u2019re not playing.\r\n- Easy and simple to play: Simple and enjoyable mechanics bring you to an adventure world.\r\n- Tap-to-play controls: Select, upgrade, and send your brave knight into battle with just a tap in this offline RPG.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Endless Fun Games\r\n- Summon shadow knight allies: Collect and summon companions to help you defeat powerful bosses.\r\n- Level up your heroes: Continuously upgrade your favorite characters in this idle RPG.\r\n- Infinite upgrades: Power up your heroes endlessly and unlock mighty abilities.\r\n- Unlimited gameplay: Battle in wars, PvP, and arenas. Upgrade your heroes, unlock new items, summon allies, and more.\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re a fan of idle RPG, strategic battles, survival, arcade games, level-up games, action role-playing games, idle clicker games and dark fantasy adventures, Shadow War: Idle RPG Survival is the perfect game for you. Enjoy the thrill of war in this epic free game, where the forces of darkness are yours to command and the idle adventure time full of shadow legends in one of the best upgrade games!\r\n\r\nDarkness Rises, Heroes Fall. Can You Rise Above?",
    "descriptionHTML": "10000 gems Giftcode: WELCOMESW<br><br>Darkness is taking over the world! As the chosen knight of the Shadow Clan, your mission in this offline RPG is to lead your army into battles, protect your kingdoms, harness the dark power of the shadows and bring peace to the shadow realm. Start the journey to become the ultimate Shadow Slayer. <br><br>Evil monsters have returned! Fight epic battles as a dark knight in a war for ultimate supremacy. Choose the most powerful knights to build your own army. Summon weapons and armors to strengthen your legion, upgrade your dark knight skills, and unlock powerful pets to defeat evil monsters.<br><br>Shadow War: Idle RPG Survival is a combination of idle action role-playing and adventure. Featuring idle RPG gameplay with both survival and offline idle RPG game elements. Shadow War provides hundreds of weapons, armors, skills with gacha features and the defenses are divided into several different worlds and endless levels.<br><br>The auto-battle system delivers idle gameplay that allows you to continuously earn resources for upgrading your hero\u2019s attack power, speed, health regen, HP, damage and critical chance, making your conquest easier. Take command in this free RPG and enjoy the ultimate dark fantasy adventure!<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br>\u2605 RPG Adventure Battles<br>- Leave no monsters standing: Defeat all demons and save the kingdom.<br>- Explore adventure features: Numerous dungeons (gem dungeon, gold dungeon, relic dungeon, trait dungeon, ring dungeon) and worlds (zodiac, world, tower, alchemy, mine) to discover, train your hero and find valuable treasure.<br>- Crush the enemies: Defeat enemies, conquer bosses and claim gems! Eliminate every evil in your path!<br><br>\u2605 RPG Progression &amp; Strategy<br>- Idle RPG offline adventure: Dive into a thrilling fantasy world filled with strategic battles!<br>- Evolve your warriors: Level up your legion for intense battle games.<br>- Customize your he